_Melee\" title=\"Main Hand Melee\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/25px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/38px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/50px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Main Hand Melee\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png/25px-Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2b/Main_Hand_Melee_Weapon_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Main_Hand_Melee\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Main Hand Melee\">Main Hand Melee</a>&nbsp;(<a href=\"/wiki/Warhammers\" title=\"Warhammers\">Warhammer</a>)\n</td>\n<td><dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Favoured_Weapon\" title=\"Favoured Weapon\">Favoured Weapon</a></dt><dd>This weapon has a +1 bonus to damage and <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/38px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/50px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Attack roll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png/25px-Attack_Roll_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/b/ba/Attack_Roll_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack roll\">Attack rolls</a>.</dd></dl>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Galvanic_Currents\" title=\"Galvanic Currents\">Galvanic Currents</a></dt><dd>This weapon deals an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">1d6</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/38px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/50px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Lightning\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png/25px-Lightning_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/31/Lightning_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Lightning\" title=\"Lightning\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-lightning\">Lightning</span></a> damage.</dd></dl>\n<ul><li>This hammer's magical powers only function if it's Bound to an <a href=\"/wiki/Eldritch_Knight\" title=\"Eldritch Knight\">Eldritch Knight</a> or is a <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlock</a>'s Pact Weapon. These effects are in addition to the weapon's +1 enchantment.</li></ul>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\" style=\"width: 50px; height: 50px; display: inline-block; vertical-align: middle; overflow: hidden;\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Gauntlets_of_Surging_Accuracy\" title=\"Gauntlets of Surging Accuracy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Gloves_Scalemail_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Gloves_Scalemail_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/c/cd/Gloves_Scalemail_A_Unfaded_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cd/Gloves_Scalemail_A_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Gloves_Scalemail_A_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"asyn